{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-09.51.15-1024x877.jpeg\">\n<p>宏福苑七幢樓被大火波及，宏建閣僅一單位遭火燒，居民（25日）繼續上樓搬走大量財物及傢俬。六歲男童 Scott，今早隨父母步上 22 樓的家，他說行樓梯辛苦，見到常去玩的公園被夷平，他亦感到失落，但開心取回畢業時獲贈的迪士尼吊牌和心愛的公仔、足球，更立刻將吊牌掛上頸。他的媽媽表示，已居宏建閣「十幾廿年」，大人更不捨得離開。她今日驚喜尋回價值五萬至六萬元的白金條，「我之前以為唔見咗呀」，惟沒找到兩顆金粒，冀能再上樓搜尋。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-13.02.11-1024x760.jpeg\">\n<p>Scott 自出生在宏建閣居住，在相鄰的廣福邨讀幼稚園，上樓前表示想尋回足球，「因為我最鍾意玩足球」，更表示已有一段時間不能跟爸爸踢波。他兩次受訪都表示，「鍾意宏福苑」，不捨得走，希望可留在宏福苑居住。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-13.02.45-1024x715.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-09.51.14-675x1024.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-09.50.43-1024x831.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-11.08.37-1024x679.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-09.51.28-1-1024x680.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-09.51.29-2-1024x781.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/WhatsApp-Image-2026-05-25-at-09.51.28-2-1024x780.jpeg\">\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-25T05:58:35.745706+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":9,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}